      "body": "This PR is part of a stack (oldest at bottom):\n\n* #44994\n* #44993\n* __->__ #44991\n* #44480\n\n## Motivation\n\nDepends on #44480. The upstream base branch points to its exact rebased head `8851b72606ff11a288d70ba2fcd8ff628f90b753`; this PR still changes only the two positional-compatibility files.\n\nAdding `enable_megamoe_for_layernorm_sp` inside the frozen field order reinterprets\nexisting positional `ServerArgs` calls. For example, argument 95 previously set\n`disable_attn_tp_gather` and now enables the new option.\n\n## Modifications\n\nRestore all remaining 536 legacy input positions by removing the new option from the\nfrozen prefix and recording the 21 older fields that the collector had already\nappended. The new option then appends after them. Its keyword/CLI inputs and\n`False` default are unchanged.\n\nAdd constructor-binding and keyword/CLI regression tests to the existing\nserver-argument unit tests.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Configured pre-commit passed. The bottom dispatcher test now has its executable CI entrypoint; strict registration and suite validation pass.\n- This PR head is `7b0f69acf824d3ead7b883267730cb83a86d17ac`. Combined stack `0177861c1117141b6e07d3c4c67b28898edd290c` passed 396 CPU tests plus 166 subtests across ten files, including all 303 ServerArgs tests. All 123 changed-file and ten test hashes matched before and after execution.\n- Current main intentionally removed `speculative_skip_dp_mlp_sync`; the positional regression now covers the remaining 536 legacy inputs and final legacy index 535. Keyword/CLI/default assertions remain unchanged.\n- Original validation at `63020d3bb7873ee2ac8648f76ede368af0b70b51` passed five CPU files (325 tests), all 537 then-existing constructor identity bindings, and fail-before controls for both the original order and an incomplete removal-only repair. Those counts retain that earlier revision's scope.\n\nCPU environment: Python 3.12.15, msgspec 0.22.0, torch 2.14.1+cu130. No new GPU, server accuracy or performance run is claimed for this restack.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39204019936](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39204019936)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #39204019610](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39204019610)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39204020102](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39204020102)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
